            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen Yesu olwoŋo lwak ji kodi jofonjirok pere bonge, to waco rijo ni, “Ŋata mito bino bongan, won mito wokwedere kende kendo wotiŋ musalaba pere woluwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 17:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 12:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri ŋata mito botho kwo pere bino rwenyo woko, to ŋata rwenyo woko kwo pere kwoŋbedo an kodi ro Wac Manyen Maber, bino botho kwo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋo ma dhano olim ka oloki piny gipi apere, to rwenyo woko kwo pere won? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋo ma dhano nyalo miyo ma wilo gine kwo pere? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo ka dhano wiye okwot kodan gi fonji paran, i ndir ma ji kuy'iye Were, ndir ma ji odakan iye, Wod Dhano bende wiye bino kwot gi ŋato ka go dwoko i dwoŋ pa Bamere kanyacel gi jomalaika maleŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
